<title>AUSTRALIA: S&amp;P rates Australia's GLASS notes A1-plus.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Australia's GLASS notes A1-plus.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit rating agency Standard and Poors Corp said on Thursday had assigned its A1-plus rating to Commonwealth Bank of Australia's Generic Loan Asset Securitisation Structures Ltd (GLASS).</p>
<p>S&amp;P also had assigned its A1-plus rating to GLASS' A$185 million series 1 commercial paper notes to be issued by GLASS under its A$600 million note programme.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
